Interrelations Between Orthogonal Polynomials of the Same Family Jacobi Polynomials
22.5.1
P_n^{(\alpha,\beta)}(x)=\frac{\Gamma(2n+\alpha+\beta+1)}{n\Gamma(n+\alpha+\beta+1)}G_n^{(\alpha+\beta+1,\beta+1,\frac{x+1}{2})}\]
22.5.2
G_n(p,q,x)=\frac{n\Gamma(n+p)}{\Gamma(2n+p)}P_n^{(p-\alpha,\delta-1)}(2x-1)
(see [22.21]).
F_n(p,q,x)=(-1)^n|\frac{\Gamma(q)}{\Gamma(q+n)}P_n^{(p-\alpha,\delta-1)}(2x-1)
(see [22.13]).
